===Etymology===
From Medieval Latin, from {{der|en|la|uva|t=grape}}, partial loan translation of Greek {{l|grc|[[ῥαγοειδής]] [[χιτών]]|t=[covering] like a grape}}, from {{l|grc|ῥάξ|t=grape}} .

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The middle of the three concentric layers that make up the eye; it is pigmented and [[vascular]], and comprises the [[choroid]], the [[ciliary body]], and the [[iris]].

